@media (max-width: 380px) { body { padding: 16px; } h1 { font-size: 18px; } }
&lt;/style&gt;&lt;/head&gt;&lt;body&gt;&lt;article&gt;
&lt;header&gt;&lt;h1&gt;What’s new&lt;/h1&gt;&lt;p class="version"&gt;con 0.1.0-beta.174 · 2026-11-08&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/header&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;Added&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;Updates&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Read the offered version’s changes before deciding to upgrade. macOS shows release notes in its native update prompt; Windows and Linux show a compact changelog alongside download, cancel and skip controls.&lt;span class="credit"&gt;PR &lt;a href="https://github.com/nowledge-co/con-terminal/pull/554"&gt;#554&lt;/a&gt; by &lt;a href="https://github.com/wey-gu"&gt;@wey-gu&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;Changed&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;Windows, Linux&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Download and verify updates while continuing to work, then restart when ready. Recognized per-user installations update the app and companion CLI together with signature verification, backups and rollback, without launching an installer console. Package-managed and custom installations retain their original update method. Restart closes running terminals and agents; existing session recovery settings apply.&lt;span class="credit"&gt;PR &lt;a href="https://github.com/nowledge-co/con-terminal/pull/554"&gt;#554&lt;/a&gt; by &lt;a href="https://github.com/wey-gu"&gt;@wey-gu&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;footer&gt;&lt;a href="https://con.nowledge.co/changelog/"&gt;Read the full changelog&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/footer&gt;
&lt;/article&gt;&lt;/body&gt;&lt;/html&gt;
</description>
